[Music]  the bad blood between the hosts of  american pickers has been very public  but did you hear about one cast member's  tax scandal keep watching to find out  who the irs had in their sights  for over 10 years television viewers  have been captivated by the wacky and  crazy finds made on the history  channel's hit reality show american  pickers countless items have been  discovered since mike wolfe frank fritz  and danielle colby first made their tv  debuts in 2010 and they continued to  unearth long-lost family artifacts and  heirlooms to this very day sometimes  they have to delve deep into a  stranger's garage to find some hidden  treasure but whether they locate old  vehicles or antique weaponry they always  tend to find something worth a pretty  penny they're masters of sorting through  various memorabilia but they're not the  only ones who enjoy digging up the past  viewers have done the research and  discovered a number of scandals and  secrets such as the controversial firing  of fritz and his reported feud with  wolfe who is still on the show for its  22nd season fritz told the sun we were  never friends in grade school i don't  believe in 10 years he said 5 nice  things to me you know unless he was  cutting somebody else down and we were  both laughing it seems like a lot of  drama for a series that's essentially  about antiquing but there's one  proverbial black eye on the show that  many fans might not know about one of  which could have potentially landed a  cast member behind bars and it's not who  you think anyone who watches american  pickers knows that danielle colby isn't  a person who cares too much about what  others think she's practically covered  from head to toe with tattoos and has  gained fame as a burlesque dancer she  marches to the beat of her own drum and  that's why fans adore her however if  there's one group of people you don't  want to upset it's the irs according to  radar online in 2013 colby reportedly  received a notice from the irs saying  she owed nearly six thousand dollars in  taxes it seemed particularly odd given  that colby is allegedly worth roughly  1.5 million dollars thanks to her  earnings from american pickers the back  taxes are reportedly related to the  reality star's burlesque boutique dubbed  four miles to memphis which received at  least four notices from the feds  documents obtained by radar online  allegedly showed that colby never filed  any returns in june 2014 she was slapped  with a notice of a lien for  5936. in estimated retail taxes for  sales that were made in december 2013.  i'm really greedy with my things my  collection is primarily um  vintage burlesque and sideshow and  circus and striptease costumes there's  currently no documentation online  proving colby paid her taxes but judging  from the fact she's not in federal  prison right now it's a safe bet that  she took care of it however the scandal  might be enough to make some fans worry  about colby's future on american pickers  especially in light of frank fritz's  departure fortunately viewers probably  won't have to say another goodbye  anytime soon colby is still on american  pickers and seems to enjoy continuing to  work with her co-star mike wolfe in fact  she posted a photo of the two of them  together on instagram in august of 2021  where she spoke highly of his character  she wrote thank you for the last decade  of advocacy towards myself and others on  set at mike wolf american picker i'm  proud of how you have handled the last  12 years and look forward to many more  years of rolling around this big blue  marble together she's been thorough in  her efforts to let the world know that  she and mike wolf are still on good  terms during the fritz firestorm colby  uploaded another photo of them together  on instagram writing quote i love  getting to spend time with mike wolfe it  definitely seems like she's on wolf's  good side and american pickers fans no  doubt hope she stays there after the  loss of frankfritz nobody wants to see  colby relegated to the dust bin of  history here's hoping she's paid all her  taxes by now otherwise the next vintage  outfit she might have to pick out for  her boutique could involve black and  white stripes  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite celebs are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

